sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as You
  participant G as Input gate
  participant S as Supervisor
  participant SP as Specialists<br/>budget, goals, subscriptions
  participant X as execute_tool<br/>(the gate)
  participant M as Merge<br/>(deterministic)
  participant R as Reviewer<br/>(Reflexion-style)
  participant K as Claim checker
  U->>G: How am I doing on budget, goals and subscriptions?
  G->>G: refuse money movement, OTPs, tips
  G->>S: allowed question
  S->>S: split into areas, one sub-question each
  par each specialist, only its own tools
    S->>SP: sub-questions
    SP->>X: read tools (policy checked, audited)
    X-->>SP: computed figures
  end
  SP-->>M: findings, or a gap instead of an error
  M->>R: merged draft
  alt a claim lacks evidence
    R->>S: one revision request (at most one)
    S->>SP: revise that part
    SP-->>M: revised findings
  end
  R->>K: reviewed answer
  K->>K: drop any number no tool computed
  K-->>U: answer with the steps shown
